## Pricing

- **Logo & brand identity — £200.** A complete package: 5 initial concepts, revisions, colour palette, typography, brand guidelines, and every file format you'll need.
- **Bundled with a new website — reduced price.** If you're also having a [website built](/services/web-design/) or taking a [Managed Starter Website](/services/managed-starter-websites/), your logo is discounted as part of the project. [Get in touch](/contact/) for a combined quote.
- **Full ownership, no ongoing fees.** One clear price, no subscription, no royalties — the finished files are yours outright.

## A logo that means business

Your logo is the first thing people notice. A strong, professionally designed logo builds trust instantly — a weak one does the opposite. Whether you're starting a new business or refreshing an existing brand, we design logos that look the part and stand the test of time.

We work with small businesses across Merthyr Tydfil and South Wales — tradespeople, retailers, service businesses, start-ups — giving them a professional identity they're proud to put on their van, their website, and their business cards.

## What's included

- **5 logo concepts** — we create 5 distinct design directions for you to choose from
- **Revisions** — we refine your chosen concept until you're happy with it
- **Brand colour palette** — primary and secondary colours that work together across all materials
- **Typography** — font choices that complement your logo and brand personality
- **Brand guidelines** — a simple document showing how to use your logo and brand correctly
- **File formats** — full resolution files in PNG, SVG, PDF, and JPEG, ready for web and print

## No AI. Real designers, real craft.

Every logo we create is designed by hand using Adobe Illustrator and Photoshop — no AI tools, no generated artwork. Our designers bring real expertise and creative thought to every brief, which means your logo is unique to your business and built with intention, not automation.

## Built to work everywhere

A good logo needs to work at any size — tiny on a website favicon, large on a sign or banner. We design in vector format so your logo scales perfectly at any size without losing quality, and supply every file format you'll ever need.

## Pair it with your new website

Your logo and brand identity are built into your website from day one. If you're having a new [website designed](/services/web-design/) alongside your logo, everything is designed together — consistent colours, fonts, and styling throughout — giving you a cohesive online presence that looks polished and professional.

