## Frequently asked questions

**How many logo concepts will I receive?**

We provide 5 initial concepts covering different directions and styles. Once you choose a favourite, we refine it through revisions until it's exactly right.

**How long does it take?**

Most logo projects are completed within 5–10 days depending on how quickly feedback is provided.

**What if I already have a logo but want it refreshed?**

No problem — we can modernise an existing logo while keeping the elements that still work, rather than starting from scratch.

**Will I own the logo?**

Yes. Full ownership of all files and designs is transferred to you on completion.

**Can you design business cards and print materials too?**

Yes — once your logo and brand are finalised we can design business cards, letterheads, flyers, and other print materials. Just ask when you get in touch.
